{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>And Many More 是一款為 iPhone、<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 與 iPad 設計的生日追蹤工具，適合希望妥善記住親友重要日子的使用者。它可手動新增、從聯絡人挑選或匯入試算表，並提供提醒、送禮規劃與小工具。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-69.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>匯入管理與貼心提醒</h2>\n<p>And Many More 可手動新增生日、從聯絡人挑選，或匯入 CSV、Excel 與 Google Sheets。它會按即將到來的生日排序，支援里程碑、標籤與搜尋；可設定個人化提醒、每週摘要，記錄送禮想法與卡片進度，並快速致電、傳訊或加入行事曆。主畫面與鎖定畫面小工具顯示下一位壽星，且沒有廣告、訂閱或資料收集。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-88-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-89-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-90-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-91-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-92-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：And Many More: Birthday Alerts</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/and-many-more-birthday-alerts/id6765561665?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:09.511227+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:55:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T18:58:26.968654+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:30.966447+00:00","content_hash":"f5cdb562fb85a1b16c5cc013f481b50c9d73849766b1b53358005a620c290b7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}